WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
Tomorrow Lu Shu Tang and the collection team

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:03,080
Ye Mianmian, follow me to the beach

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,480
Who will leave the team privately again?

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:06,800
It's good to make dinner by yourself

5
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,200
Find a chance to leave the team together tomorrow

6
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,120
If discovered

7
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,160
Just say your feet hurt

8
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,280
I said I would come back with you

9
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,560
Lies don’t need to be perfect

10
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:20,280
Just follow us as far as Su Che

11
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:23,360
I brought the people just in time. You two can take one side.

12
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:24,840
spread it open

13
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:26,320
This stinks

14
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:28,680
If you don't want to do it, you can go back

15
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,880
What's wrong? My legs are stretched straight.

16
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:31,840
Don't let the skin roll up

17
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,000
I shave off the fat

18
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,800
After drying, it can be used as a mat for Brother Su Che

19
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,280
This job is much more tiring than I thought

20
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:46,620
So the meal is not free. How do you feel?

21
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:49,940
It’s much better than what we have at our camp, so remember it.

22
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:50,980
This is not a loss

23
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:53,580
It's your salary today. Thank you.
